caption: Changelog
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

!! v1.3.2 (2026-05-04)

* Fixed per-card hover lazy loading so card previews render after the card is hovered instead of staying blank.
* Restored the original card preview transclusion path while keeping the hover-triggered reveal state.
* Updated card styles so the hover event wrapper preserves the previous card layout and hover appearance.

!! v1.3.0 (2026-04-28)

* Added a hover-to-show lazy rendering mode for the bottom reference area, enabled by default to reduce initial render cost on large wikis.
* Added a recent navigation section so the current tiddler can jump back to the tiddler it was just opened from.
* Restored the original backlink, tag folder, slash folder, and backtransclude sections while integrating the new recent navigation block.